<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>New Connection Request - Affinity Echo</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f8f9fa; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: white; }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); padding: 40px; text-align: center; color: white; }
        .content { padding: 40px; }
        .footer { background: #f1f3f4; padding: 25px; text-align: center; color: #666; font-size: 14px; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; }
        .button { display: inline-block; padding: 14px 35px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; margin: 25px 0; }
        .info-box { background: #e7f3ff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 28px;">New Connection Request</h1>
            <p style="margin: 10px 0 0; opacity: 0.9; font-size: 16px;">Someone wants to connect with you</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello <strong style="color: #667eea;"><%= username %></strong>,</p>
            <p style="font-size: 16px;">You have a new connection request on Affinity Echo. A community member is interested in connecting with you through a referral.</p>

            <div class="info-box">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;">What does this mean?</p>
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #0066cc;">Someone from the community has expressed interest in connecting with you. You can review and respond to this request from your dashboard.</p>
            </div>

            <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
                <a href="<%= viewUrl %>" class="button">View Request</a>
            </div>

            <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666;">Remember, your identity remains anonymous until you choose to reveal it.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px;">You're receiving this because someone sent you a connection request.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px;">Need help? Contact us at <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>" style="color: #667eea;"><%= supportEmail %></a></p>
            <p style="margin: 15px 0 0; font-size: 12px;">&copy; 2024 Affinity Echo. Building stronger professionals together.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>